{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a trip to the beach, Arthur enters a sand castle building contest. Help him and The Brain build the greatest sand castle ever and win first prize! Watch out, though--it's not as simple as it seems...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create a winning castle!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a diagram or design your own!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Arthur cross the hot sand!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build-a-castle machine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect parts for The Brain's special castle-building machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four different activities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three levels of difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step-by-step guides help kids build castles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Print out a newspaper story about your own unique sand castle.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579330?t=1756952410","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579330/0d354708970d168e24f36db94bca0b3322142229/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756952410","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579330/941c74f7de80bae81148a0552d6ce50ac17cf98f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756952410","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579330/941c74f7de80bae81148a0552d6ce50ac17cf98f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756952410","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a trip to the beach, Arthur enters a sand castle building contest. Help him and The Brain build the greatest sand castle ever and win fi